{"id":"k4f5dsl2hyjimqzli25t7f90f","title":"魏茨曼科学研究所与以色列理工学院合作：长DNA链将混沌流体运动转化为稳定节律","originalTitle":"Long DNA strands turn chaotic fluid motion into a steady rhythm","summary":"魏茨曼科学研究所与以色列理工学院团队在《Nature Physics》发表研究，发现长DNA链可将混沌流体运动转化为毫米级有序振荡。实验表明DNA链长度超过临界阈值（约3.2毫米）时，分子马达驱动的流体运动通过DNA网络形成机械反馈，使原本无序的涡旋运动产生周期性反向振荡。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-dna-strands-chaotic-fluid-motion.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T15:00:10.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T16:17:51.400Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T16:17:51.400Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":54,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8d3f1c5b-93cb-40e9-b911-5725d942cf54","title":"长DNA链将混沌流体运动转化为稳定节律"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8d3f1c5b-93cb-40e9-b911-5725d942cf54","title":"长DNA链将混沌流体运动转化为稳定节律"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fQSBauvnMtV8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}